.TH QUERENCIA-WEBHUELLE 1 "October 2026" "querencia-webhuelle 0.2.0" "Querencia Desktop"
.SH NAME
querencia-webhuelle \- wrapper for WhatsApp Web in a window of its own
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B querencia-webhuelle
.RI [ GTK-OPTION ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B querencia-webhuelle
(Querencia Web Wrapper, German \(lqQuerencia Webh\(:ulle\(rq) shows WhatsApp
Web in a window of its own, with the classic menu bar of Querencia Desktop
(File, Edit, View, Help). It is not a product of WhatsApp or Meta and is not
affiliated with them.
.PP
The sign-in is kept in
.I ~/.local/share/querencia-webhuelle
and
.IR ~/.cache/querencia-webhuelle ,
the settings in
.IR ~/.config/querencia-webhuelle/einstellungen.ini .
File \(-> Log Out and Delete Data removes the stored data after a question.
.PP
A second start brings the open window to the front (one GTK application
with the ID
.BR org.querencia.Webhuelle ).
Calls are not possible: the web engine of Ubuntu is built without WebRTC.
.SH MOVING FROM QUERENCIA MESSAGES
Until version 0.1.1 the program was called Querencia Messages
.RB ( querencia-nachrichten ).
On its first start the wrapper renames the folders
.I querencia-nachrichten
in
.IR ~/.local/share ,
.I ~/.cache
and
.I ~/.config
to
.IR querencia-webhuelle ;
nothing is copied or deleted, so the sign-in stays. While the old program
is still running, the wrapper only says so and does not start. If a folder
of the new name exists already, the old one is left untouched.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Ctrl+R, F5
reload
.TP
.B Ctrl+Plus, Ctrl+Minus, Ctrl+0
zoom in, zoom out, normal size (remembered)
.TP
.B F11
full screen
.TP
.B F1
help
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
quit
.SH SEE ALSO
https://querencialinux.org
